        "subject": "LU-20462 idl: reserve OBD_CONNECT2_FIND_UTILITY flag",
        "message": "LU-20462 idl: reserve OBD_CONNECT2_FIND_UTILITY flag\n\nReserve OBD_CONNECT2_FIND_UTILITY at 0x4000000000000ULL for the\nserver-side namespace scanner of the Lustre Find Utility.  Only the\nflag, obd_connect_names[] and the wire checks are added here so the\nvalue can land before the feature patch.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: Id2d4daac2b05bb1876f1dd8424b74d2be6b1df28\n"
